        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SHP40, 4 Inch Rectangular Cabinet Cup Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 4 Inch Modern Rectangular Cup Pull is great for use on kitchen cabinets. It is available in a huge selection of finish colors, all of which emphasize the contemporary feel of this 4 Inch Rectangular Shell Pull. The 4 Inch Rectangular Cabinet Cup Pull is easy to install and comes packaged with the mounting hardware. It will add a clean, polished look to any home kitchen remodel. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SHP40-specifications.gif?v=1704354562\" width=\"600\" height=\"166\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SHP40 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/7-inch-modern-rectangular-cup-pull-deltana-shp70\"><b>Deltana SHP70 7 Inch Modern Rectangular Cup Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SHP40-installed.jpg?v=1704354562\" width=\"284\" height=\"219\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Deltana SHP40 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern 4 Inch Rectangular Cabinet Shell Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed either vertically or horizontally.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SHP40-specifications.pdf?v=1704262365\"><b>Deltana SHP40 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "4 Inch Modern Rectangular Cup Pull",
                "description": "The 4 Inch Modern Rectangular Cup Pull is great for use on kitchen cabinets. It is available in a huge selection of finish colors, all of which emphasize the contemporary feel of this 4 Inch Rectangular Shell Pull. The 4 Inch Rectangular Cabinet Cup Pull is easy to install and comes packaged with the mounting hardware. It will add a clean, polished look to any home kitchen remodel. \r\n",
